  "description": "RSS and ATOM feed reader/parser. FeedReader is a .net standard 1.3 library used for reading and parsing RSS and ATOM feeds. Supports RSS 0.91, 0.92, 1.0, 2.0 and ATOM. Library tested with multiple languages and feeds.",
