  "readmeFile": "README.MD",
  "releaseNotes": "- Fix: well-formed URLs are no longer URL-decoded before download, so escaped characters (e.g. /, : in query strings) are kept. Note: '+' is no longer converted to a space for such URLs.\n- Fix: redirects with relative Location headers and HTTP 307 are followed.\n- Fix: Helpers.TryParseDateTime returns null instead of throwing for values without a space.\n- Fix: RSS feeds without a version attribute are parsed instead of throwing.\n- Fix: feed link detection in HTML matches attribute names case-insensitively.\n- Fix: ReadFromFileAsync opens files read-only and always reads the complete file.\n- Change: Atom Feed.Link and FeedItem.Link now use the rel=\"alternate\" link (preferring text/html) per RFC 4287 instead of the first link element.\n- Fix: Atom feed-level categories are read from the \"term\" attribute (were empty before).\n- New: ItunesChannel.Type and Keywords; ItunesItem.Episode, Season, EpisodeType and Keywords.",
